1
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:08,920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

2
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:38,920
ADAPTED FROM <i>JIA JIN CHAI</i>, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

3
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:46,400
Welcome back to the palace, Your Majesty.

4
00:01:46,480 --> 00:01:47,600
ETERNAL SPLENDOR

5
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:51,200
I hear someone persuaded
His Majesty to issue a decree

6
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:53,520
allowing Noble Lady Wu'an

7
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:56,720
to divorce the heir to the Duke of Ying.

8
00:01:56,800 --> 00:01:59,160
Lady Li, the Empress Dowager
arranged that marriage herself.

9
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,960
Yet you acted without informing her

10
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:02,720
and made the decision on your own.

11
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:05,240
You've overstepped your authority.

12
00:02:05,320 --> 00:02:06,800
Your Majesty, allow me to explain.

13
00:02:07,360 --> 00:02:08,880
Wu'an made a noble sacrifice

14
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:10,840
and married Lu Zhuo to help him recover.

15
00:02:10,919 --> 00:02:14,040
Sadly, their personalities clashed,
and the marriage failed.

16
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,200
Rather than let them grow
to resent each other

17
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,520
and fail to appreciate
Your Majesty's kindness,

18
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:21,080
it was better to let them part ways.

19
00:02:21,160 --> 00:02:23,040
Have you heard the rumors
in the capital, Lady Li?

20
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:25,240
People are saying

21
00:02:25,320 --> 00:02:27,880
her own mother is a woman of loose morals

22
00:02:27,960 --> 00:02:29,880
who pushed her daughter
to divorce and remarry.

23
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:30,800
LADY ZHENG

24
00:02:30,880 --> 00:02:33,800
They're also spreading gossip
about your past.

25
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:35,760
And the things
they're saying are truly disgraceful.

26
00:02:36,600 --> 00:02:37,480
It's simply

27
00:02:37,560 --> 00:02:40,480
a stain on His Majesty's good name
and the Imperial Family's honor.

28
00:02:41,680 --> 00:02:43,680
Lady Li was only concerned
for her daughter.

29
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:44,800
She never meant to defy Your Majesty.

30
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:47,800
Please consider her love as a mother

31
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:48,960
and forgive her offense.

32
00:02:49,560 --> 00:02:52,560
What's done is done.
Their marriage cannot be saved.

33
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,400
Besides, as for the divorce,

34
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:56,560
His Majesty gave his consent.

35
00:02:57,480 --> 00:02:58,360
How dare you!

36
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,480
His Majesty's lifelong reputation

37
00:03:00,560 --> 00:03:02,280
has been ruined by you!

38
00:03:03,440 --> 00:03:04,920
Yet you show no remorse.

39
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,000
You can't even raise
your own daughter properly!

40
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:09,960
Very well. If you can't teach her,

41
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:12,120
I'll do it myself.

42
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,080
To put an end to the gossip,

43
00:03:15,160 --> 00:03:18,760
find Wu'an another husband at once.

44
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:23,280
Han Liao, heir to the Marquis of Xiting,

45
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,840
is a fine warrior
who recently lost his wife.

46
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,400
He won't mind marrying a divorced woman.

47
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:32,360
She should stay out of the public eye

48
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:34,720
and focus on being a dutiful wife.

49
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:35,720
In time,

50
00:03:36,320 --> 00:03:38,640
the rumors will die down.

51
00:03:44,400 --> 00:03:46,040
Even the palace rarely sees sea pearls

52
00:03:46,680 --> 00:03:48,040
of such fine quality.

53
00:03:48,720 --> 00:03:51,120
Lord Han, what is it you want?

54
00:03:53,480 --> 00:03:55,320
I wish to marry Lady Wu'an.

55
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:57,640
I humbly ask Your Majesty
to grant my request.

56
00:03:58,240 --> 00:03:59,520
Absolutely not.

57
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:03,000
No Han shall marry that wretch's daughter!

58
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:04,880
Please calm yourself, Your Majesty.

59
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:05,800
GRACIOUS BLESSINGS

60
00:04:05,880 --> 00:04:09,280
Wu'an seized vast estates
and lands belonging to my family

61
00:04:09,360 --> 00:04:10,960
and humiliated me.

62
00:04:11,040 --> 00:04:12,920
Marrying her would return them to us

63
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:16,880
and give us leverage over Lady Li.

64
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:19,880
His Majesty must name
a crown prince someday.

65
00:04:19,959 --> 00:04:22,040
Please consider what that means.

66
00:04:24,720 --> 00:04:27,440
Thank you for caring about
my daughter's future, Your Majesty.

67
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:30,920
However, His Majesty has said

68
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:34,200
the annual military competition
always draws exceptional talent.

69
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:36,520
He wishes to choose
Wu'an's husband himself.

70
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,960
If Lord Han is truly such a great warrior,

71
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,400
he should have no trouble winning.

72
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:46,280
But this year's competition
will be rather unusual.

73
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:48,400
I'm afraid Lord Han

74
00:04:49,840 --> 00:04:50,840
may not dare enter.

75
00:04:52,920 --> 00:04:54,120
What makes it so unusual?

76
00:04:54,720 --> 00:04:58,040
He must first survive
the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow Formation.

77
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,520
<i>The Thousand-Bolt Crossbow?</i>

78
00:05:00,120 --> 00:05:02,080
I hear it's a new weapon
from the Imperial Workshop.

79
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:04,200
It can fire thousands of bolts at once.

80
00:05:04,280 --> 00:05:05,880
Even heavy shields
are shredded within 300 paces.

81
00:05:05,960 --> 00:05:07,000
Incredible!

82
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:09,080
This year's competition
will be quite a spectacle!

83
00:05:09,160 --> 00:05:10,200
Indeed.

84
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:12,000
The competition is usually held
at the military camp.

85
00:05:12,080 --> 00:05:13,880
But this year,
it's been moved to Shanglin Park.

86
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:16,800
Perhaps His Majesty suddenly wants
to watch warriors fight,

87
00:05:17,480 --> 00:05:19,360
or maybe there's another reason.

88
00:05:20,520 --> 00:05:21,720
What other reason could there be?

89
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,960
His Majesty plans to inspect
the troops during the competition

90
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:26,560
and select the most capable men.

91
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:30,240
Lu Zhuo,

92
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,880
you look terribly ill.

93
00:05:32,960 --> 00:05:35,520
You mustn't compete again this year.

94
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:38,840
If Lu Zhuo doesn't compete,
who will win for the Lu family?

95
00:05:43,680 --> 00:05:46,120
Let my second brother have a chance.

96
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,520
Brother, do you really mean that?

97
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:50,960
Grandfather, I can do it.
Please let me compete.

98
00:05:56,560 --> 00:05:58,840
Since your brother has spoken for you,

99
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:00,520
- you may give it a try.
- Yes, Grandfather!

100
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:03,680
Remember, your brother
went ten years without a single defeat.

101
00:06:04,200 --> 00:06:05,360
Don't bring shame upon the Lu family.

102
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:07,880
I won't let you down, Grandfather.

103
00:06:08,520 --> 00:06:10,120
Very well. You may go.

104
00:06:11,160 --> 00:06:12,200
We take our leave, Grandfather.

105
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:17,400
Well, look at you!

106
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:20,000
I've already found
the perfect match for you.

107
00:06:20,600 --> 00:06:22,920
Xie Hualou,
Grand Tutor Xie's eldest granddaughter,

108
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,480
is beautiful, talented, and virtuous.

109
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:27,120
She's more than fit to be
the future mistress of this household.

110
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,640
I'll send a marriage proposal tomorrow.

111
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:31,600
Lu Zhuo has only just divorced.

112
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:34,360
How can you arrange
another marriage so soon?

113
00:06:34,440 --> 00:06:35,360
Isn't that terribly hasty?

114
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,920
I'm not asking him to marry her tomorrow.

115
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,800
We can arrange the engagement first.

116
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:42,120
They can marry in a year or so.

117
00:06:45,440 --> 00:06:46,840
Grandfather,

118
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:49,880
I'd like to make my own decision
about marriage.

119
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:52,680
Your decision?
Lady Xie is both beautiful and talented.

120
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:55,440
She's a hundred times better
than that reckless Wei Rao!

121
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:57,240
And you're still pining for her?

122
00:06:57,320 --> 00:06:58,800
Has the illness clouded your judgment?

123
00:06:58,880 --> 00:07:00,000
You're the one who's lost his senses!

124
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,560
You were the one who insisted

125
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:02,880
on arranging his marriage
to the Wei family.

126
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,920
Now you want him to marry a Xie instead.

127
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,840
He's barely divorced,

128
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,520
and you're already rushing
to find him another wife.

129
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:11,640
What will people say about Lu Zhuo?

130
00:07:11,720 --> 00:07:13,360
Haven't you heard
the news from the palace?

131
00:07:13,440 --> 00:07:14,560
Every family has been told

132
00:07:14,640 --> 00:07:16,160
to send its finest unmarried young men
to compete.

133
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:18,360
There are no princesses waiting to marry.

134
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,440
Who do you think it's for?

135
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:23,920
You mean the palace
is choosing a husband for Wei Rao?

136
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,640
What Lady Li is doing

137
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,920
is a slap in the face
to our entire family!

138
00:07:28,520 --> 00:07:30,240
They're already choosing
a noble husband for her.

139
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:31,880
I'm pushing you to find another wife

140
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:35,600
so you'll finally face reality
and stop clinging to false hopes!

141
00:07:39,880 --> 00:07:42,400
Lu Zhuo, what are we going to do?

142
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,080
Grandmother, we're already divorced.

143
00:07:45,600 --> 00:07:47,200
She and I have nothing to do
with each other now.

144
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:50,920
Whoever she marries
is entirely her choice.

145
00:07:53,600 --> 00:07:54,880
What a cruel twist of fate!

146
00:07:55,400 --> 00:07:56,520
Fine.

147
00:07:56,600 --> 00:07:58,480
Then go and see for yourself,

148
00:07:58,560 --> 00:08:01,480
how Lady Wu'an chooses her new husband.

149
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,000
Of course I'll go.

150
00:08:04,520 --> 00:08:07,000
But only to watch my second brother win.

151
00:08:08,120 --> 00:08:10,520
Fine. Very well!

152
00:08:11,080 --> 00:08:14,640
You really are as stubborn as they come!

153
00:08:15,640 --> 00:08:17,760
Let's see how long
you can keep up that act.

154
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,560
Princess Consort Duan
is known for her virtue.

155
00:08:29,640 --> 00:08:31,520
She truly deserves that reputation.

156
00:08:31,600 --> 00:08:33,200
Thank goodness she's so sensible.

157
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:34,960
If Lady Chan had made a scene,

158
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:37,080
who knows what rumors would be spreading?

159
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:48,360
My Lady, Lady Li sent me

160
00:08:49,080 --> 00:08:50,760
to wait here for you.

161
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:52,760
What's all this?

162
00:08:53,440 --> 00:08:56,360
The military competition
is in three days at Shanglin Park.

163
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,880
You've been invited to attend.

164
00:09:04,320 --> 00:09:05,520
ZHUYU ESTATE

165
00:09:05,600 --> 00:09:08,440
THREE DAYS LATER

166
00:09:13,040 --> 00:09:13,880
Send for Bitao.

167
00:09:16,400 --> 00:09:17,440
Yes, My Lady.

168
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,320
That girl

169
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,560
is far too impulsive.

170
00:09:30,040 --> 00:09:30,880
Come here.

171
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:46,520
I'm not used to anyone else
doing my hair and makeup.

172
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:49,240
I'd rather you do it from now on.

173
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:55,840
My Lady!

174
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,400
There, now.

175
00:10:00,360 --> 00:10:02,320
I have a banquet to attend.
I can't be late.

176
00:10:02,920 --> 00:10:03,960
Come, help me get ready.

177
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:11,600
I'll get you ready, My Lady.

178
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,600
ZHUYU ESTATE

179
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:35,200
The bricks, tiles, reeds,
and bamboo arrive today.

180
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,280
Keep an eye on the silkworm house.

181
00:10:36,880 --> 00:10:39,200
My Lady, please let me go with you.

182
00:10:39,280 --> 00:10:41,960
No. The estate's work comes first.

183
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,360
None of you need to come.

184
00:10:56,960 --> 00:10:59,400
LIU SHUO, THE EMPEROR'S FOURTH SON

185
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:01,440
This estate belongs to Lady Wu'an.

186
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,760
Outsiders shall not enter.

187
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:05,360
Who are you? You can't just barge in!

188
00:11:09,520 --> 00:11:11,920
Why did you run in front of the horse?
Do you have a death wish?

189
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,400
This is His Highness, the Fourth Prince!

190
00:11:13,480 --> 00:11:14,800
Go inform Lady Wu'an at once!

191
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,200
Your Highness.

192
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,680
My Lady. My… my Lady.

193
00:11:21,760 --> 00:11:22,840
I heard.

194
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,800
So you're my elder sister.

195
00:11:37,840 --> 00:11:38,880
We haven't met before.

196
00:11:38,960 --> 00:11:41,320
- I'm…
- You're Lady Li's son,

197
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:43,960
His Majesty's beloved Fourth Prince.

198
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,760
I traveled the provinces
to further my studies.

199
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,120
Only returned to the capital two days ago.

200
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:50,160
I've wanted to meet you ever since.

201
00:11:50,760 --> 00:11:53,440
But Mother was afraid I'd startle you,
so she kept forbidding me to come.

202
00:11:53,520 --> 00:11:56,000
But… Today is
your first palace banquet, Rao.

203
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,600
So I came especially to escort you.

204
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,720
I've prepared a carriage. Come, Rao.

205
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,360
I have my own carriage.

206
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,360
You needn't trouble yourself,
Your Highness.

207
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:08,440
Rao! Sister.

208
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:11,920
You don't seem to like me very much.

209
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,560
I wouldn't dare.

210
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:14,920
What is it?

211
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:17,480
Are you jealous because Mother
has always been by my side?

212
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:19,040
Or are you angry that

213
00:12:19,120 --> 00:12:21,560
I haven't visited you all these years?

214
00:12:22,520 --> 00:12:24,200
What exactly are you trying
to say, Fourth Prince?

215
00:12:25,120 --> 00:12:26,880
You'll understand
once you enter the palace.

216
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:29,560
It's full of wicked old witches
who'd eat kids alive.

217
00:12:29,640 --> 00:12:32,000
Mother kept her distance to protect you.

218
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:34,160
After all, from the moment I was born,

219
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,240
we've been on the same side.

220
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:38,960
What makes you say that?

221
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,280
If Mother and I are doing well,

222
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:43,040
you'll have a good life too.

223
00:12:43,560 --> 00:12:46,480
But if Mother and I ever fall,
you'll suffer a terrible fate.

224
00:12:47,080 --> 00:12:48,200
Our interests are tied together.

225
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,040
So you have every reason
to be close to me.

226
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,600
We should be the very best of friends!

227
00:12:58,840 --> 00:13:00,200
Your Highness.

228
00:13:00,280 --> 00:13:01,600
No need to be so formal with me.

229
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:02,680
Just call me Shuo from now on.

230
00:13:03,400 --> 00:13:06,480
Come, let me help you
into the carriage. Here.

231
00:13:06,560 --> 00:13:09,480
ZHUYU ESTATE

232
00:13:10,880 --> 00:13:11,720
Watch your step.

233
00:13:20,520 --> 00:13:21,760
I'll lead the way for you, Rao.

234
00:13:23,760 --> 00:13:24,720
<i>Is he…</i>

235
00:13:26,520 --> 00:13:29,040
<i>really my own flesh-and-blood brother?</i>

236
00:13:51,240 --> 00:13:53,920
Han Liao is incredibly strong and cunning.

237
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:54,920
He often fights dirty.

238
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:58,680
If you face him, be extremely careful.

239
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,520
I've trained in martial arts for years.

240
00:14:00,600 --> 00:14:02,360
You're underestimating me.

241
00:14:02,440 --> 00:14:03,280
Lu Ya.

242
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:42,560
You probably aren't used
to gatherings like this.

243
00:14:43,200 --> 00:14:45,040
And there are many people you don't know.

244
00:14:45,120 --> 00:14:46,240
I'll sit with you for a while.

245
00:14:46,880 --> 00:14:48,080
Thank you, Princess Consort Duan.

246
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:56,200
His Majesty is testing
the new crossbows this year.

247
00:14:56,280 --> 00:14:57,720
All the military officers
are eager to compete.

248
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,480
Look, even Han Liao has entered.

249
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,120
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

250
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:14,480
- Well done!
- Bravo!

251
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:16,440
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

252
00:15:16,520 --> 00:15:18,560
- He's taking on three men at once.
- Truly remarkable.

253
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,480
What an amazing fight.

254
00:15:19,560 --> 00:15:21,000
Indeed.

255
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,840
Give that to Lady Wu'an.

256
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:25,480
- Hurry.
- Yes, My Lord.

257
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:36,560
Lord Han wishes
to present today's spoils to Lady Wu'an.

258
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:39,880
He's won more than ten matches today.

259
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,680
His reputation
as an undefeated general is well deserved.

260
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:46,000
Truly, none can rival him.

261
00:15:47,640 --> 00:15:48,560
Quite so.

262
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:50,080
His endurance is astounding.

263
00:15:50,160 --> 00:15:53,320
My Lady. General Qi
asked me to bring you this fruit platter.

264
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:11,200
Please thank General Qi for me.

265
00:16:12,320 --> 00:16:14,960
General Qi and Lord Han
are both exceptional warriors.

266
00:16:15,040 --> 00:16:18,160
Rao, who do you think will win today?

267
00:16:18,760 --> 00:16:20,840
Both generals have their strengths.

268
00:16:20,920 --> 00:16:22,280
It's hard to say who will win.

269
00:16:30,040 --> 00:16:31,720
His Majesty has arrived!

270
00:16:51,240 --> 00:16:53,040
Everyone, rise.

271
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,360
Let the competition continue!

272
00:17:04,480 --> 00:17:06,200
Rao, forgive me for interfering.

273
00:17:06,280 --> 00:17:07,599
Both General Qi and Lord Han

274
00:17:07,680 --> 00:17:08,960
are going out of their way to court you.

275
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:12,880
But a woman who entertains two suitors

276
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,960
is bound to attract gossip.

277
00:17:14,560 --> 00:17:16,520
I suggest you be more careful,

278
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:18,920
lest Lady Li take offense.

279
00:17:22,440 --> 00:17:24,560
Rao, come here.

280
00:17:37,560 --> 00:17:39,880
May Your Majesty enjoy good health

281
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,440
and Your Majesty the Empress Dowager
enjoy endless happiness.

282
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:43,640
Your Majesty,

283
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:45,720
look at this young lady.

284
00:17:46,560 --> 00:17:48,480
She doesn't look

285
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:50,360
quite like her mother, does she?

286
00:17:53,520 --> 00:17:56,720
She looks just as I remember.

287
00:17:57,480 --> 00:17:59,960
Beautiful, graceful, and poised.

288
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:02,640
Come, give her a seat.

289
00:18:04,080 --> 00:18:05,280
Thank you, Your Majesty.

290
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,000
She is Lady Wu'an.

291
00:18:16,960 --> 00:18:18,480
Lady Wu'an,

292
00:18:18,560 --> 00:18:20,560
so many fine warriors have gathered today.

293
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:24,600
Yet Right General Han Liao
stands above them all.

294
00:18:24,680 --> 00:18:27,320
Not one man here
has been able to defeat him.

295
00:18:27,400 --> 00:18:28,840
He's truly an exceptional warrior.

296
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:31,680
What do you think of him?

297
00:18:31,760 --> 00:18:34,080
The competition isn't over.

298
00:18:34,160 --> 00:18:37,440
How can you be sure
Han Liao will emerge victorious?

299
00:18:40,280 --> 00:18:41,360
How many matches has he won?

300
00:18:42,240 --> 00:18:45,160
Your Majesty, Lord Han
has won fifteen straight matches,

301
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,440
defeating every challenger.

302
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:48,320
No one else dares enter the arena.

303
00:18:49,240 --> 00:18:50,560
It seems we've searched the entire army,

304
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,280
Lady Li,

305
00:18:52,800 --> 00:18:56,040
and still found no warrior
capable of defeating Han Liao.

306
00:18:57,720 --> 00:18:58,760
I'll fight him!

307
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:11,920
Shunqin.

308
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,840
Has General Qi had too much wine?

309
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:15,080
His legs seem rather unsteady.

310
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:18,680
Or is he simply outmatched
and too afraid to fight?

311
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:22,040
There's something wrong with the wine.

312
00:19:24,120 --> 00:19:25,240
Help him away first.

313
00:19:25,320 --> 00:19:26,440
- Yes, My Lord.
- Summon a physician to examine him.

314
00:19:40,960 --> 00:19:43,040
I've won every match today!

315
00:19:43,560 --> 00:19:46,920
Well? Anyone else think they can beat me?

316
00:19:49,240 --> 00:19:52,240
He has no respect for the Lu family!

317
00:19:52,320 --> 00:19:54,720
General Han, I'll take you on!

318
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:57,240
Lu Ya, don't be reckless!

319
00:19:57,320 --> 00:19:58,680
Who is he?

320
00:19:58,760 --> 00:20:00,920
Admirable courage.

321
00:20:41,000 --> 00:20:41,960
- How is he?
- Help him up!

322
00:20:42,040 --> 00:20:43,480
- Help him up!
- Oh my.

323
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:48,040
- Sixteen straight victories.
- Oh my.

324
00:20:48,120 --> 00:20:49,600
Simply unrivaled!

325
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,560
- No one's a match for him.
- He's unbeatable.

326
00:20:51,640 --> 00:20:53,760
- How remarkable.
- He has no equal!

327
00:21:00,600 --> 00:21:01,760
He can still fight on?

328
00:21:05,840 --> 00:21:08,600
<i>Lu Zhuo. Can't you see?</i>

329
00:21:08,680 --> 00:21:10,160
<i>He's deliberately provoking you</i>
<i>into fighting.</i>

330
00:21:19,640 --> 00:21:22,400
Lord Lu, accidents happen in the arena.

331
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:25,120
Forgive me for injuring your brother.

332
00:21:25,880 --> 00:21:28,400
I heard your old illness has returned,
leaving you too sick to leave home.

333
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:31,280
I suggest you stay out of this.

334
00:21:31,360 --> 00:21:33,520
I'd hate to be accused
of an unfair victory.

335
00:21:34,880 --> 00:21:35,840
After you.

336
00:21:59,320 --> 00:22:00,640
Let's see what happens.

337
00:22:54,800 --> 00:22:55,840
Watch out!

338
00:23:20,960 --> 00:23:24,320
Of the Four Elite Armies,
the Shenwu Army is the strongest.

339
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:27,320
For years, the Lu family
has held it firmly in their grasp.

340
00:23:28,120 --> 00:23:31,360
Even my son and I
must tread carefully around them.

341
00:23:31,440 --> 00:23:33,240
Are you truly confident

342
00:23:33,760 --> 00:23:35,520
you can defeat Lu Zhuo?

343
00:23:35,600 --> 00:23:38,040
With Your Majesty's support,

344
00:23:38,560 --> 00:23:41,160
killing Lu Zhuo
and seizing military command

345
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:43,080
will be child's play.

346
00:23:44,320 --> 00:23:47,120
You have crossbows backing you,
yet you resort to sneak attacks.

347
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:49,760
Hardly an honorable victory, Lord Han.

348
00:23:49,840 --> 00:23:52,000
On the battlefield,
victory is all that matters.

349
00:23:52,600 --> 00:23:55,480
A defeated man
has no right to demand fairness.

350
00:24:10,920 --> 00:24:14,000
Your Majesty, is today's competition

351
00:24:14,080 --> 00:24:15,720
open only to noble families?

352
00:24:16,720 --> 00:24:19,240
Lady Wu'an, Lady Li
cares deeply about your future.

353
00:24:19,320 --> 00:24:23,000
She hopes to find you a worthy husband
among our rising military officers.

354
00:24:23,520 --> 00:24:26,520
Don't tell me
you'd marry some lowborn soldier

355
00:24:26,600 --> 00:24:29,080
and make him your husband.

356
00:24:30,520 --> 00:24:33,240
Rao, the Empress
is kindly helping you find a husband.

357
00:24:33,880 --> 00:24:35,880
With so many warriors competing today,

358
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:38,360
you should choose a true hero.

359
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:41,720
My daughter deserves nothing less.

360
00:24:42,400 --> 00:24:46,000
Don't worry. Speak your mind.

361
00:24:46,720 --> 00:24:49,160
Your Majesty,
choosing my husband is a minor matter.

362
00:24:49,240 --> 00:24:50,920
Choosing capable generals
matters far more.

363
00:24:51,000 --> 00:24:52,760
Neither should depend on noble birth.

364
00:24:52,840 --> 00:24:55,440
If nobles can compete, why not commoners?

365
00:24:56,040 --> 00:24:58,320
Great generals have always
come from noble families.

366
00:24:58,400 --> 00:25:01,520
What could an illiterate foot soldier
possibly know?

367
00:25:01,600 --> 00:25:02,440
How could he command an army?

368
00:25:02,520 --> 00:25:05,480
Lady Wu'an lives in seclusion.
She knows nothing of state affairs.

369
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:06,760
We can't blame her for that.

370
00:25:06,840 --> 00:25:10,240
Lady Wu'an,
ignoring rank will only bring chaos.

371
00:25:10,840 --> 00:25:12,920
Are you ignorant,
or deliberately stirring up trouble?

372
00:25:13,600 --> 00:25:16,360
I hear your estate
has taken in many scholars.

373
00:25:16,440 --> 00:25:17,520
They haven't been recommended for office,

374
00:25:17,600 --> 00:25:19,320
nor do they come from military families.

375
00:25:19,400 --> 00:25:21,960
Lady Wu'an, you shouldn't let
those scholars lead you astray.

376
00:25:22,960 --> 00:25:25,080
This is supposed
to be a martial arts competition.

377
00:25:25,160 --> 00:25:28,000
Victory should depend on skill,
not family background.

378
00:25:28,080 --> 00:25:30,160
Anyone with exceptional fighting skills

379
00:25:30,240 --> 00:25:31,320
could become a valuable officer.

380
00:25:31,400 --> 00:25:33,360
That's what a fair competition should be.

381
00:25:34,200 --> 00:25:36,760
Do enemy swords and blades

382
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:39,320
distinguish nobles from commoners?

383
00:26:11,520 --> 00:26:12,800
Starting tomorrow,

384
00:26:13,320 --> 00:26:16,120
all soldiers may enter the competition.

385
00:26:16,760 --> 00:26:19,800
Win three matches in a row,
and you'll be promoted one rank.

386
00:26:20,320 --> 00:26:22,760
The champion
will receive a title based on merit.

387
00:26:23,640 --> 00:26:27,240
Long live Your Majesty!

388
00:26:27,320 --> 00:26:28,960
Now see
what the Thousand-Bolt Crossbow can do.

389
00:26:33,080 --> 00:26:34,320
Look!

390
00:26:34,400 --> 00:26:37,600
How did Lord Han lose so suddenly?

391
00:26:49,120 --> 00:26:51,480
Save him! Hurry! Someone help him!

392
00:26:55,720 --> 00:26:56,640
Your Majesty!

393
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:57,960
Lu Zhuo used the competition
to settle a personal grudge.

394
00:26:58,040 --> 00:26:59,800
He deliberately injured Lord Han!

395
00:26:59,880 --> 00:27:02,680
I beg Your Majesty
to grant the Han family justice

396
00:27:02,760 --> 00:27:04,080
and punish the culprit severely!

397
00:27:04,160 --> 00:27:07,560
Your Majesty, injuries happen in combat.

398
00:27:07,640 --> 00:27:09,720
Lord Lu was injured too.

399
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:13,320
- Everyone saw that he…
- Who here actually saw what happened?

400
00:27:13,400 --> 00:27:15,360
It was clearly a fair fight.

401
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:17,040
How can you call that deliberate assault?

402
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:19,800
He lost because he wasn't good enough.
Who else can he blame?

403
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:23,880
You praised him
as the greatest warrior alive.

404
00:27:23,960 --> 00:27:27,120
I thought he must be
an incredible fighter.

405
00:27:27,200 --> 00:27:30,320
Turns out he's not much of one at all.

406
00:27:30,400 --> 00:27:34,360
Your Majesty, the Lu and Han families
have never been on good terms.

407
00:27:34,440 --> 00:27:36,840
Lu Zhuo deliberately injured him.

408
00:27:36,920 --> 00:27:38,600
That makes his offense even worse.

409
00:27:39,320 --> 00:27:41,880
I beg Your Majesty to judge this fairly.

410
00:27:50,760 --> 00:27:53,360
Winning and losing
are part of any competition.

411
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:57,480
Accusing him of deliberate assault
is utterly groundless.

412
00:27:58,160 --> 00:28:00,160
Summon the imperial physicians
to treat the injured.

413
00:28:00,880 --> 00:28:02,240
Today's competition

414
00:28:02,760 --> 00:28:04,120
- will continue as planned.
- Yes, Your Majesty.

415
00:28:17,520 --> 00:28:18,560
Lord Lu!

416
00:28:26,160 --> 00:28:29,360
ZHAO

417
00:28:36,760 --> 00:28:37,760
Your Majesty.

418
00:28:43,480 --> 00:28:44,400
Are his injuries really that serious?

419
00:28:46,520 --> 00:28:49,120
<i>Does he mean Han Liao, or…</i>

420
00:28:49,640 --> 00:28:50,920
Rao.

421
00:28:51,920 --> 00:28:52,960
Rao.

422
00:28:57,160 --> 00:28:58,040
Look.

423
00:28:58,640 --> 00:28:59,560
That young man

424
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:02,440
is Li Wei, the third son
of the Marquis of Zhennan.

425
00:29:03,120 --> 00:29:06,880
He's rather young,
and he lacks experience.

426
00:29:06,960 --> 00:29:10,200
But his character
and looks are exceptional.

427
00:29:10,280 --> 00:29:12,640
He's nearly as impressive as Lu Zhuo.

428
00:29:13,520 --> 00:29:16,320
Qi Zhongkai is a fine choice too.

429
00:29:16,400 --> 00:29:18,560
But his mother is difficult to deal with.

430
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:21,800
Besides, the Qi and Lu families
are very close.

431
00:29:21,880 --> 00:29:24,160
I'm afraid that would make things awkward.

432
00:29:28,880 --> 00:29:30,240
Rao.

433
00:29:31,600 --> 00:29:33,840
There's no turning back now.

434
00:29:48,880 --> 00:29:50,760
Forgive me, My Lady! It was an accident!

435
00:29:50,840 --> 00:29:52,080
How could you be so careless?

436
00:29:52,680 --> 00:29:55,040
It's all right.
I'll go change and come back.

437
00:29:56,520 --> 00:29:58,280
Escort Lady Wu'an to Fanghua Hall.

438
00:29:58,360 --> 00:29:59,240
Yes, My Lady.

439
00:30:07,760 --> 00:30:10,440
Isn't Juzhi on duty today?

440
00:30:10,520 --> 00:30:12,040
I'm worried
she may not serve her properly.

441
00:30:12,120 --> 00:30:13,480
Go and help her.

442
00:30:20,720 --> 00:30:22,600
Where is Lord Lu?

443
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:26,320
My Lady, I believe Lord Lu
is being treated at Anfu Hall.

444
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:28,840
That's where injured competitors
are usually taken.

445
00:30:28,920 --> 00:30:30,080
Lead the way.

446
00:30:30,160 --> 00:30:31,000
Yes, My Lady.

447
00:30:36,760 --> 00:30:38,120
General Li is truly formidable!

448
00:30:38,200 --> 00:30:39,680
He knocked that strongman out
with one punch!

449
00:30:39,760 --> 00:30:40,880
Indeed!

450
00:30:40,960 --> 00:30:42,280
- Look at him!
- Lady Li praised him highly.

451
00:30:42,360 --> 00:30:44,080
She might even choose him
as her son-in-law!

452
00:30:44,160 --> 00:30:45,440
- Really?
- You insolent fool!

453
00:30:45,520 --> 00:30:46,920
What nonsense are you spouting?

454
00:30:48,960 --> 00:30:50,000
They're fighting again.

455
00:30:50,520 --> 00:30:52,560
- Look.
- Where on earth has Lady Wu'an gone?

456
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:01,720
My Lord, your wounds are quite serious.

457
00:31:01,800 --> 00:31:03,640
Bear with it. The medicine.

458
00:31:09,600 --> 00:31:11,640
CHANGYANG PALACE

459
00:31:13,400 --> 00:31:14,360
Lady Wu'an is here to visit the injured.

460
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:21,760
Lu Zhuo!

461
00:31:29,960 --> 00:31:30,880
Outside…

462
00:31:32,200 --> 00:31:33,600
Has anyone come to see me?

463
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:34,520
My Lord,

464
00:31:34,600 --> 00:31:36,440
apart from the messenger His Majesty sent

465
00:31:36,520 --> 00:31:37,360
to check on you, no one else has come.

466
00:31:42,360 --> 00:31:43,200
My Lord!

467
00:31:47,480 --> 00:31:49,280
My Lord, I haven't finished treating you!

468
00:31:49,360 --> 00:31:51,080
- My Lord, aren't you getting treated?
- My Lord!

469
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:53,400
- My Lord!
- Quick! Go after him and bring him back!

470
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:54,320
Yes!

471
00:32:16,640 --> 00:32:17,640
How thoughtful of you, My Lady,

472
00:32:17,720 --> 00:32:19,440
to still be concerned about me.

473
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:22,920
All my efforts
to win you over weren't wasted.

474
00:32:23,000 --> 00:32:24,320
I'm not here to see you.

475
00:32:29,920 --> 00:32:32,320
Han Liao, what are you trying to do?

476
00:32:32,920 --> 00:32:35,400
You can marry me properly
and become Lady Han,

477
00:32:36,240 --> 00:32:38,320
or be branded an adulteress.

478
00:32:40,560 --> 00:32:41,560
The choice is yours.

479
00:32:46,200 --> 00:32:47,440
Absurd.

480
00:32:48,080 --> 00:32:49,240
Who would believe you?

481
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:52,120
A respectable young lady
from a good family

482
00:32:52,760 --> 00:32:56,120
having an affair with a womanizer like me?

483
00:32:56,200 --> 00:32:57,400
Of course no one would believe it.

484
00:32:58,800 --> 00:33:00,960
But your birth mother is a social climber!

485
00:33:01,040 --> 00:33:03,160
The women of your Zhou family

486
00:33:03,240 --> 00:33:04,680
have reputations far worse than mine!

487
00:33:08,920 --> 00:33:10,880
Suppose I open that door right now

488
00:33:11,560 --> 00:33:13,640
and tell everyone

489
00:33:15,520 --> 00:33:17,160
you had an affair with me,

490
00:33:17,840 --> 00:33:19,760
and that's why you divorced Lu Zhuo.

491
00:33:20,360 --> 00:33:23,360
Think they'd believe me?

492
00:33:27,080 --> 00:33:28,560
So you're saying

493
00:33:29,680 --> 00:33:31,840
no matter how hard I try,

494
00:33:33,440 --> 00:33:34,680
I could never clear my name.

495
00:33:37,080 --> 00:33:40,680
That ruthless ex-husband of yours

496
00:33:42,800 --> 00:33:45,720
sent me straight into
that crossbow formation.

497
00:33:46,320 --> 00:33:50,200
There's barely an inch of me left unhurt.

498
00:33:54,280 --> 00:33:56,560
If I hadn't been wearing a chest plate,

499
00:33:57,320 --> 00:33:59,240
I'd have died right there.

500
00:34:02,560 --> 00:34:03,440
Tell me,

501
00:34:04,080 --> 00:34:06,520
if he saw you in my arms right now,

502
00:34:07,040 --> 00:34:08,639
what kind of face would he make?

503
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:19,760
They say Lord Han is charming

504
00:34:20,280 --> 00:34:21,840
and irresistible to women.

505
00:34:23,000 --> 00:34:24,199
I'm not so sure.

506
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:26,679
I'm right here. I'm not going anywhere.

507
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:29,639
Yet you're being so rough.

508
00:34:30,679 --> 00:34:32,040
You're hurting me.

509
00:34:33,040 --> 00:34:34,400
Let go of me.

510
00:34:37,600 --> 00:34:39,760
Don't even think about trying anything.

511
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:44,600
You stepped into this hall today.

512
00:34:45,600 --> 00:34:48,000
The rumors will haunt you for life.

513
00:35:01,040 --> 00:35:02,200
Lord Lu!

514
00:35:02,280 --> 00:35:04,040
You can't leave those wounds untreated!

515
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:06,200
Your clothes are soaked in blood!

516
00:35:06,840 --> 00:35:09,080
- How am I supposed to explain this?
- Don't follow me.

517
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:20,240
Who's in there?

518
00:35:27,320 --> 00:35:29,760
You think you can ruin my reputation
and force me to marry you?

519
00:35:30,440 --> 00:35:31,600
Then you don't know me at all.

520
00:35:32,200 --> 00:35:33,360
If that day ever comes,

521
00:35:34,000 --> 00:35:35,840
I'll cut you to pieces first.

522
00:35:49,880 --> 00:35:51,440
What are you doing here?

523
00:35:51,520 --> 00:35:52,560
I came to change my clothes.

524
00:35:56,360 --> 00:35:58,360
This isn't where the ladies change.

525
00:36:00,520 --> 00:36:03,200
Wei Rao. You came to see me.

526
00:36:06,240 --> 00:36:07,440
You were worried about me.

527
00:36:10,560 --> 00:36:12,120
Don't flatter yourself.

528
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,520
A clever woman like you

529
00:36:17,240 --> 00:36:18,600
actually lost your head

530
00:36:19,120 --> 00:36:20,360
and walked right into a trap.

531
00:36:23,160 --> 00:36:24,360
You really weren't worried?

532
00:36:26,960 --> 00:36:29,040
You fainted on purpose back there? I…

533
00:36:30,880 --> 00:36:33,760
Wei Rao, you still have feelings for me.

534
00:36:38,160 --> 00:36:39,280
You jerk!

535
00:36:40,240 --> 00:36:43,160
I was supposed to take Lady Wu'an
to Fanghua Hall to change.

536
00:36:43,240 --> 00:36:44,520
But when we got near this place…

537
00:36:44,600 --> 00:36:47,720
Lady Wu'an said she'd lost her sachet
and sent me to look for it.

538
00:36:47,800 --> 00:36:50,160
But when I returned, she was gone.

539
00:36:50,240 --> 00:36:51,680
Have you searched the entire area?

540
00:36:52,280 --> 00:36:55,080
A grown woman
can't just vanish into thin air.

541
00:36:55,160 --> 00:36:58,000
This park stretches for miles,
with countless buildings.

542
00:36:58,560 --> 00:37:00,120
Perhaps she took a wrong turn.

543
00:37:00,200 --> 00:37:01,480
I'm sure we'll find her soon.

544
00:37:02,640 --> 00:37:05,280
Come. Let's check the west wing

545
00:37:05,360 --> 00:37:07,840
and ask if anyone has seen Lady Wu'an.

546
00:37:14,200 --> 00:37:15,400
He's still breathing.

547
00:37:16,000 --> 00:37:19,320
Her Majesty the Empress
and Lady Li have arrived!

548
00:37:28,520 --> 00:37:30,000
You're the one who sent him
into that crossbow trap.

549
00:37:30,080 --> 00:37:31,240
You deal with him.

550
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:32,680
What are you doing?

551
00:37:34,040 --> 00:37:35,520
There's a lake outside, and no way out.

552
00:37:36,080 --> 00:37:37,360
And you're still laughing?

553
00:37:39,640 --> 00:37:40,480
Are you all right?

554
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:45,760
What a performance.

555
00:37:46,720 --> 00:37:49,200
I'm just taking a page
out of your book, Lady Wu'an.

556
00:37:53,520 --> 00:37:55,120
Who's hiding in there?

557
00:37:55,720 --> 00:37:56,920
Break down that door!

558
00:37:57,560 --> 00:37:59,080
Just tell them I did it.

559
00:37:59,600 --> 00:38:00,560
You had nothing to do with it.

560
00:38:01,240 --> 00:38:02,720
You're going to take the blame for me?

561
00:38:02,800 --> 00:38:03,880
Han Liao and I
have been enemies for years.

562
00:38:03,960 --> 00:38:05,840
It's already a fight to the death.

563
00:38:05,920 --> 00:38:07,080
One more offense won't matter.

564
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:09,320
Her Majesty is here! Open the door!

565
00:38:09,840 --> 00:38:11,040
Open up in there!

566
00:38:13,520 --> 00:38:14,760
There's no need.

567
00:38:16,040 --> 00:38:17,720
I'm hardly some sheltered young lady.

568
00:38:17,800 --> 00:38:19,680
Even if I killed that lecher on the spot,

569
00:38:19,760 --> 00:38:21,360
he'd have brought it on himself.

570
00:38:21,960 --> 00:38:23,800
I'll take responsibility
for what I've done.

571
00:38:25,120 --> 00:38:26,160
I won't drag anyone else into it.

572
00:38:30,880 --> 00:38:31,480
CHANGYANG PALACE

573
00:38:31,560 --> 00:38:32,880
Open up in there!

574
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:51,880
Your Majesty.

575
00:38:51,960 --> 00:38:53,040
Lady Wu'an?

576
00:38:54,000 --> 00:38:55,000
What are you doing here?

577
00:38:55,680 --> 00:38:57,760
Rao, are you all right?

578
00:38:58,400 --> 00:38:59,720
Did he frighten you?

579
00:39:00,240 --> 00:39:01,640
Lord Han is recovering here.

580
00:39:02,440 --> 00:39:04,480
Why is there no one attending to him?

581
00:39:05,280 --> 00:39:07,040
How could you neglect him like this?

582
00:39:10,360 --> 00:39:13,760
Don't be afraid.
Mother's here. I'll protect you.

583
00:39:28,520 --> 00:39:30,360
Lord Han, Her Majesty is here.

584
00:39:31,880 --> 00:39:32,920
Lord Han?

585
00:39:35,040 --> 00:39:36,080
Lord Han!

586
00:39:36,840 --> 00:39:38,200
Her Majesty is here!

587
00:39:45,120 --> 00:39:46,600
Why is Lord Lu here?

588
00:39:53,160 --> 00:39:54,520
Lu Zhuo pays respects to Your Majesty

589
00:39:55,240 --> 00:39:56,840
and to the ladies of the court.

590
00:39:57,360 --> 00:39:58,520
Lord Lu, you're badly wounded.

591
00:39:58,600 --> 00:40:00,560
There's no need for formalities.

592
00:40:00,640 --> 00:40:02,320
Isn't this Lord Han's room?

593
00:40:02,400 --> 00:40:05,440
Well, Lord Han was supposed
to be recovering here.

594
00:40:05,520 --> 00:40:08,120
For some reason, he's gone.
I'll investigate right away.

595
00:40:14,720 --> 00:40:16,200
Why has Lady Wu'an come back?

596
00:40:17,400 --> 00:40:18,240
I've made myself perfectly clear.

597
00:40:19,520 --> 00:40:21,920
We're divorced,
and we have nothing to do with each other.

598
00:40:23,120 --> 00:40:26,200
My injuries are none of your concern.

599
00:40:27,520 --> 00:40:28,520
We should keep our distance.

600
00:40:29,800 --> 00:40:31,480
- Keep our distance?
- Of course we should!

601
00:40:32,520 --> 00:40:34,960
The physician was treating my wounds
when you barged in,

602
00:40:35,720 --> 00:40:37,600
sent him away, and locked the door.

603
00:40:38,440 --> 00:40:39,600
What were you thinking?

604
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,520
I told you to leave

605
00:40:42,240 --> 00:40:43,480
because I didn't want people thinking

606
00:40:44,080 --> 00:40:47,840
you were still pining for your ex-husband.

607
00:40:48,560 --> 00:40:50,480
The Lu family has strict standards.

608
00:40:51,240 --> 00:40:52,680
Even if you deeply regret the divorce

609
00:40:53,280 --> 00:40:54,840
and want us to get back together,

610
00:40:54,920 --> 00:40:56,640
I'd have to consult my grandmother first.

611
00:40:57,240 --> 00:40:59,320
We can't sneak around
behind everyone's backs.

612
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:01,960
Don't accuse me of being heartless.

613
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:03,720
I had to protect my reputation

614
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:05,000
and yours, Lady Wu'an.

615
00:41:05,520 --> 00:41:06,960
I had no other choice.

616
00:41:07,880 --> 00:41:09,040
Please show some restraint.

617
00:41:10,120 --> 00:41:12,680
What? Did I say anything untrue?

618
00:41:13,280 --> 00:41:15,400
Didn't you come to check on me?

619
00:41:16,080 --> 00:41:17,640
You got furious when I turned you away

620
00:41:18,480 --> 00:41:19,880
and smashed everything in the room.

621
00:41:20,400 --> 00:41:22,320
The evidence is right before everyone.

622
00:41:23,720 --> 00:41:24,600
Are you still going to deny it?

623
00:41:27,160 --> 00:41:28,080
Rao.

624
00:41:28,600 --> 00:41:30,480
Did you come here
specifically to see Lord Lu?

625
00:41:36,040 --> 00:41:37,320
The Wei and Lu families

626
00:41:38,800 --> 00:41:40,000
have been close for generations.

627
00:41:40,680 --> 00:41:43,320
His elders have always treated me kindly.

628
00:41:43,960 --> 00:41:46,680
Though Lord Lu and I
weren't meant to remain husband and wife,

629
00:41:46,760 --> 00:41:48,480
our families' long friendship
still matters.

630
00:41:49,080 --> 00:41:51,000
He's like an older brother to me,
and he's badly hurt.

631
00:41:51,080 --> 00:41:52,520
Of course I should come see him.

632
00:41:53,560 --> 00:41:56,680
I kept it quiet to avoid gossip.

633
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:02,520
Your Majesty, Lord Han has disappeared.

634
00:42:15,360 --> 00:42:16,680
Lu Zhuo.

635
00:42:18,000 --> 00:42:19,400
His wound must have reopened.

636
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:21,480
Someone fetch the imperial physician.

637
00:42:21,560 --> 00:42:22,840
If Lord Lu's condition worsens,

638
00:42:22,920 --> 00:42:24,440
who will take responsibility? Hurry!

639
00:42:24,520 --> 00:42:25,880
- Yes, My Lady.
- Yes, My Lady.

640
00:42:25,960 --> 00:42:28,640
Lord Lu is one
of His Majesty's favored officials.

641
00:42:28,720 --> 00:42:30,560
Oh, what are we going to do?

642
00:42:34,240 --> 00:42:35,640
Please rest and recover, Lord Lu.

643
00:42:41,360 --> 00:42:42,200
Your Majesty.

644
00:42:45,480 --> 00:42:48,080
Rao, come with me.

645
00:43:15,720 --> 00:43:17,560
- Rao, did you…
- No.

646
00:43:20,280 --> 00:43:23,440
Today, the Empress
had someone lure me to a side hall

647
00:43:23,520 --> 00:43:25,800
so I'd be alone with Han Liao.

648
00:43:26,360 --> 00:43:28,880
She wanted to use my reputation
to force me into submission.

649
00:43:29,640 --> 00:43:31,160
No wonder she went to such lengths

650
00:43:31,240 --> 00:43:32,840
to ask us all there.

651
00:43:33,880 --> 00:43:35,920
And we should thank Lu Zhuo

652
00:43:36,000 --> 00:43:37,280
for putting things aside and saving you.

653
00:43:37,360 --> 00:43:40,200
At least that proves
he's a man who takes responsibility.

654
00:43:40,720 --> 00:43:42,160
- So do you still have feelings…
- No.

655
00:43:46,360 --> 00:43:48,360
Whatever we had ended long ago.

656
00:43:48,440 --> 00:43:52,360
No. There was never any love
between us to begin with.

657
00:43:54,080 --> 00:43:56,880
If that's what you say,
then Mother believes you.

658
00:44:00,360 --> 00:44:01,200
Really?

659
00:44:03,760 --> 00:44:04,840
You…

660
00:44:06,920 --> 00:44:08,360
You're still laughing.

661
00:44:18,120 --> 00:44:19,320
Your Majesty.

662
00:44:19,400 --> 00:44:21,560
We found Lord Han in the bushes
behind the east wing.

663
00:44:22,160 --> 00:44:24,360
He's badly injured and still unconscious.

664
00:44:24,440 --> 00:44:26,120
We haven't been able to question him.

665
00:44:28,640 --> 00:44:30,400
Lu Zhuo. Wei Rao.

666
00:44:30,480 --> 00:44:32,120
You've gone too far!

667
00:44:32,640 --> 00:44:34,400
What does Your Majesty intend to do?

668
00:44:35,280 --> 00:44:37,240
His Majesty keeps protecting that woman.

669
00:44:37,320 --> 00:44:39,160
I can't touch that wretch.

670
00:44:39,240 --> 00:44:42,800
But surely
I can deal with her little brat.

671
00:44:43,960 --> 00:44:47,640
Lu Zhuo wiped out
the bandits on South Mountain.

672
00:44:50,400 --> 00:44:52,000
Those bandits

673
00:44:52,600 --> 00:44:55,520
have plagued the court for years.

674
00:44:56,200 --> 00:44:58,360
Surely a few escaped

675
00:44:58,440 --> 00:45:01,400
and came seeking
revenge against Lady Wu'an.

676
00:45:02,120 --> 00:45:03,680
A brilliant plan, Your Majesty.

677
00:45:14,640 --> 00:45:16,240
Rao, you barely ate at the banquet.

678
00:45:16,960 --> 00:45:19,200
Mother specifically asked me
to bring you some pastries

679
00:45:19,800 --> 00:45:21,320
for the ride home. Here.

680
00:45:27,520 --> 00:45:28,600
Today must have frightened you, Rao.

681
00:45:29,200 --> 00:45:30,160
Don't worry.

682
00:45:30,240 --> 00:45:31,800
The palace is full of
schemes and backstabbing.

683
00:45:31,880 --> 00:45:33,160
You'll get used to it.

684
00:45:34,800 --> 00:45:37,680
I never could. I'd rather go home.

685
00:45:38,280 --> 00:45:39,840
I really envy you, Rao.

686
00:45:39,920 --> 00:45:41,480
At least you have a home to return to.

687
00:45:41,560 --> 00:45:44,080
As for me, the palace is my only home.

688
00:45:47,880 --> 00:45:49,880
Rao, someone's here to pick you up!

689
00:45:54,760 --> 00:45:55,680
Stop the carriage!

690
00:46:05,200 --> 00:46:07,520
My Lady, you were gone so long,
I've come to welcome you home.

691
00:46:07,600 --> 00:46:09,240
What's so urgent?

692
00:46:09,320 --> 00:46:11,440
The silkworm house
has been fully thatched.

693
00:46:11,520 --> 00:46:13,760
We're all waiting for you to return.
By custom,

694
00:46:13,840 --> 00:46:15,840
the owner must be the first
to enter a newly built house.

695
00:46:19,600 --> 00:46:20,800
Watch out!

696
00:48:37,000 --> 00:48:39,720
‪NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‪IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
